  "bodyAvailable": true,
  "blocks": [
    {
      "type": "narration",
      "text": "引导2到主界面"
    },
    {
      "type": "background",
      "backgroundId": "bg_indoor_1"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "最后一个！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "呃啊！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "剩余目标已清除。敌方小队溃退了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......Dr.{@nickname}的指挥确实和阿米娅说的一样，让人放心。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是吧，轻轻松松吧？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士曾经经历的，可不只是这种程度的战斗。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "咳......怎么会出现......乌萨斯人以外的阻碍......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "整合运动成员",
      "speakerId": "char_1002_nsabr",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不会......让你们阻挠我们的事业！"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "别想得逞！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜，杜宾教官！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "你在发什么呆！差一点，你就要被打成筛子了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "对，对不起！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "快！重整队形！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "近卫干员",
      "speakerId": "char_013_riop",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜宾！你来了！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "情况紧急。我的小组也遭到了攻击，敌人同样是整合运动。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "所以我才立刻赶过来跟你们汇合。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "整合运动为什么会攻击我们......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "一个感染者权益组织......本来我觉得他们只是有点盲目激进————"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "————现在居然开始使用暴力，还是在乌萨斯的城市？真是自寻死路。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "接下来，这里只会变得更加混乱。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿米娅，我们必须立刻撤离切尔诺伯格。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "好的。我们已经成功救出博士，之后按照计划撤退就可以了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——这位就是Dr.{@nickname}？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是，是的。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}，你可能不认识我，但你认识阿米娅，为了你的安全着想——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "唔，杜宾，博士目前的状态并不是很好。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "简单地说，博士......失忆了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "失忆？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......这怎么办？你还准备将指挥权交给这个......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士依然有能力指挥小队。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......至少，在刚才的战斗中，我已经确认了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我还是不能这么简单就相信一个陌生人。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但我相信你，阿米娅。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......我知道了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "Dr.{@nickname}， 我是行动组E1组长，杜宾。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "我们将把你从这座乌萨斯的城市——切尔诺伯格，护送到罗德岛。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "身处切尔诺伯格城的核心区废弃设施，现在的我们理应向西撤退。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "但......和凯尔希医生通讯中断时，我和杜宾教官都需要先带领着各自的小组，去西边的集结地汇合然后确认撤出信号。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "按照计划，原本是这样的......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果能这么顺利就好了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "今天是我们从石棺救走你的最后机会，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "只是......我总有种不祥的预感。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "阿，阿米娅！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "怎么了?"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "医疗干员",
      "speakerId": "char_016_medic",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "是......是来自罗德岛的对话请求！"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "通讯接上了吗！难道说，是凯尔希医......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "？？？",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "很抱歉，并不是。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PRTS......？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "应急神经连接请求被意外触发了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "罗德岛号方面也受到干扰，只有神经连接可以勉强进行。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "无法用电波通讯联系到尚未回到罗德岛的凯尔希。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "已经确认过阿米娅您的安全，那么我的任务就已经完成了。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这东西......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "现在真的是时候吗？"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不需要使用您的神经连接操作罗德岛的话，我将在稍后断开连接。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "如果打扰到了您的派对，万分抱歉。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "不不！别挂断......我需要你帮个忙。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "杜宾，博士需要这些帮助。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "杜宾",
      "speakerId": "char_130_doberm",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "了解了，抓紧时间。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "博士，PRTS也是我们的......同伴，它会指导你下一步的动作。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然时间很紧张，但现在，我要为你重新连接至罗德岛的后勤系统。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "这样在我们作战的时候，你也能利用它为我们取得优势。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "可能会很难习惯，和说话不太一样，但只要好好使用，就一定能使整个救援作战更加顺利，所以请你......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "......相信我吧。按你想要的那样，按你熟悉的那样......"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "PRTS......开始吧。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "需要确认管理员身份，请选择识别方式。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "阿米娅",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "啊，博士......请你说句话。"
    },
    {
      "type": "choice",
      "options": [
        {
          "label": "（说话）",
          "value": "1",
          "blocks": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "虽然不知道为什么你不说话，反而触碰了一下屏幕中央——"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——不过我已经找到了相匹配的指纹。身份确认，权限水平：8。"
    },
    {
      "type": "dialogue",
      "speakerName": "PRTS",
      "speakerId": "char_002_amiya",
      "isRemote": false,
      "text": "——欢迎回家，Dr.{@nickname}。"
    },
    {
      "type": "sceneBreak"
    }
  ],
